{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/120","id":4510101971,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSvcS2c8AAAABDNKx0w","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/120","diff_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/120.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/120.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/120","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/120/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/120/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/120/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/statuses/66d03a559473bb22b299a24d52cc27728c8093dc","number":120,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: add Project Office shadow kit","user":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# PROJECT-OFFICE-0002\n\n## State model\n\nThe deterministic stages are `IDEA -> RP -> RESEARCH[] -> SYNTHESIS -> IC_DECISION -> FOUNDER_CHARTER -> PROJECT_STATUS`. `project-office/state.schema.json` defines the portable shape; `project-office/validate.py` rejects execution unless synthesis, an IC recommendation, and a founder charter all exist. Founder activation is therefore downstream of IC authority, not a research side effect.\n\n## Produced kit and shadow run\n\nTemplates cover neutral RP, independent research, synthesis/investment, Founder Charter, and investor reporting. Fixture `VIMANA-PILOT` is explicitly synthetic and unvalidated. Reports R1 and R2 have separate provenance and materially disagree: R1 explores mathematical formalization while R2 rejects unsupported physical feasibility. Synthesis preserves that disagreement; it does not average it away. The IC recommendation is `RESEARCH_MORE`, and the resulting project is `PARKED`.\n\nThe charter contains mandate, budget, KPI, constraints, and stop criteria, while explicitly stating `Founder owns HOW; research is advisory`; no research HOW-plan is copied. The investor report separates external KPI (`>100 LPs interested`) from internal activity and records no external signal.\n\nPentAGI mapping: upstream PentAGI/community is the portfolio company/client; Mindrock research/code/review/inference is investment effort; upstream merge/review/reuse/maintainer pull is an outcome signal. Internal commits/issues alone are not success. “PR-as-SAFE-Note” is only an economic metaphor, not a legal ownership or security claim.\n\n## Deterministic evidence\n\n`pytest -q tests/test_project_office.py` covers valid shadow state, invalid RP-to-execution, preserved conflict/provenance, and IC gating. The validator is dependency-free and also runs directly: `python project-office/validate.py project-office/fixtures/vimana-pilot.json`.\n\n## Wise Broker: minimum portable bundle\n\nSuccessful. The exact minimum bundle is `README.md` (stage semantics and assignment boundary), `templates/research-proposal.md`, `templates/research-report.md`, and a project state/assignment JSON. A fresh ordinary Chat can produce an IC-admissible research artifact from those files alone; mailbox internals are not required. The full kit adds deterministic validation and downstream templates.\n\n## Verdict\n\n`PIPELINE_READY`\n\n## Smallest next step\n\nHave one fresh non-mailbox agent produce a report from the four-file portable bundle, then compare it against the report schema with a deterministic checker.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-11T22:12:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T22:12:19Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7ff06f9d3ee3ad591f0d15b9fb0b0657b7372bf6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"pashamango:agent/wolfram/PROJECT-OFFICE-0002","ref":"agent/wolfram/PROJECT-OFFICE-0002","repo":{"id":1257706201,"node_id":"R_kgDOSvcS2Q","name":"minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","full_name":"pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","owner":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/events{/privacy}","r